      {"sa": "ādāya", "en": "having taken away", "hi": "निकाल लेने पर"},
      {"sa": "eva", "en": "even so, still", "hi": "फिर भी"},
      {"sa": "avaśiṣyate", "en": "remains", "hi": "शेष रहता है"}
    ],
    "translation": {
      "en": "That (the Supreme) is complete and whole, and this (the manifested universe) is also complete and whole. From that completeness, this completeness has come. Even after this completeness is taken from that completeness, that completeness alone remains.",
      "hi": "वह (परमात्मा) पूर्ण है और यह (प्रकट जगत) भी पूर्ण है। उस पूर्ण से ही यह पूर्ण उत्पन्न हुआ है। पूर्ण से पूर्ण को निकाल लेने पर भी पूर्ण ही शेष रहता है।"
    },
    "audioUrl": "audio/ISO Invocation_final.m4a"
  },
